            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Bevor er schlafen ging, las er ein Buch. Before he went to bed, he read a book."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The verb goes to the end: bevor der Film beginnt. The preposition is vor: vor dem Film."
            }
          ]
